{title: Mera Dil Bhi Kitna Pagal Hai}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Nadeem Shravan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Mera dil bhi kit [D] na pagal hai,        Yeh [E] pyar to tum se [A] karta hai.
Par [A] saamne jab tum [E] aate ho,        Par [A] saamne jab tum [E] aate ho,
Kuch [D] bhi kehne se [E] darta [A] hai.        O mere [D] saajan o mere [A] saajan
Saajan [D] saajan, mere [A] saajan,        [A] Mera dil bhi kit [D] na pagal hai,
Yeh [E] pyar to tum se [A] karta hai.        Kit [A] na is ko sama [D] jhata hoon
Kit [A] na is ko beh [D] lata hoon.        Naa [D] daan hai kuch na sa [A] majhata hai
Din [E] raat ye aahen [A] bharta hai.        Har [A] pal mujhko tad [D] pata hai,
Mujhe [A] saari raat ja [D] gata hai.        Is [D] baat ki tumko [A] khabar nahi,
Ye [E] sirf tumhi pe [A] marta hai.        Saajan [D] saajan, saajan [A] saajan
Saajan [D] saajan, saajan [A] saajan
